phi-adapter-sdk-qt (0.7.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The TLS fields an adapter offers are decided here: tls, tlsCaFile,
    tlsVerifyHostname, with a reader beside them so every adapter takes
    the same answer from the same value. Off unless asked, and verified
    when on.

 -- Marius Schumacher <google@phisys.com>  Sun, 30 Aug 2026 10:37:10 +0200

phi-adapter-sdk-qt (0.6.1-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Adapter::port defaults to 0. It was the one member of the struct without an
    initialiser, so an adapter built field by field carried whatever was on the
    stack until someone assigned it.
 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Fri, 21 Aug 2026 16:03:45 +0200

