phi-adapter-sdk-qt (0.5.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Bound the grace period after QThread::terminate() to 250ms so a forced
    backend stop stays inside the caller's shutdown budget (F-33).
  * Rebuild against phi-adapter-sdk 0.5.0.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 18:07:51 +0200

phi-adapter-sdk-qt (0.4.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add phi::qt::createFactoryExecutionBackend() for
    AdapterFactory::createFactoryExecutionBackend(): a Qt thread with an event
    loop for factory-scope hooks, so blocking device probes no longer stall IPC
    (F-31).
  * Rebuild against phi-adapter-sdk 0.4.0 (AdapterFactory vtable change).

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:47:37 +0200

phi-adapter-sdk-qt (0.3.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add phi::qt::SidecarDriver: drives a SidecarHost from the Qt event loop via
    QSocketNotifier on the host poll descriptor - no polling interval, no idle
    wakeups, and no more starving the Qt event loop with a blocking poll.
  * Rebuild against phi-adapter-sdk 0.3.0.

 -- Marius Schumacher <marius.schumacher@phisys.com>  Wed, 19 Aug 2026 10:20:56 +0200

phi-adapter-sdk-qt (0.2.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Add phi::adapter-contract-qt: header-only Qt-facing wrapper over the
    canonical v1 adapter contract (phi/adapter/qt/*.h), the single shared
    copy consumed by phi-core and Qt-based adapters.

